<title>USA: AlphaNet Telecom hotel fax pacts extended.</title>
<headline>AlphaNet Telecom hotel fax pacts extended.</headline>
<dateline>RAMSEY, N.J. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>AlphaNet Hospitality Systems Inc, a unit of AlphaNet Telecom Inc, on Monday said it signed multiyear contract extensions with the Hyatt Hotels Corp and the Fairmont Hotel Management Co to provide facsimile service in their hotel rooms.</p>
<p>The extensions are for at least two years at both hotel chains, AlphaNet said.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed in a news release issued by the company.</p>
</text>
